      401.89,
      344.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Pradeshiya Sabha(Amendment) Act, No. of 2014 and shall come into operationon such date as the Minister may appoint by Order Publishedin the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
